stars starry expanse night~
   The endless night sky stretches out above you, streaked every few moments
by a shooting star. It would be tranquil if not for three large, blazing
meteors that dot the sky, each trailing smoke through the air.
~
E
smoke fire fiery~
Long, smoky tails follow behind three fiery meteors that dot the sky.
~
E
down bottom~
   A black, craggy rock rests in the center of the crater. A small tunnel cuts
beneath it, though you can't see what's down there from here.
~
E
rock meteorite~
   The rock is dark in color and heavily pocked, but it has a smooth, almost
polished finish. The flattened surface of the rock makes up the floor of the
crater, though certainly the rock is larger and partially buried.
~
E
craggy~
The rock has a craggy, pock-marked surface.
~
E
archways portals~
   On three sides of you -- east, west, and south -- craggy stone archways
mark the edges of the platform. They begin to glow like portals if you approach
them, and you can see through to another place inside.
~
E
platform~
   The flat top of the rock forms a large platform. Archways mark the east,
west, and south edges of the platform.
~
E
north~
The platform continue north, where Tane is stacking supplies.
~
E
out around~
All you can see from here is the rim of the crater. Above that, only sky.
~
